- if opp first `setTimeout(()=>app.runAiTurn?.(), 1000)`.
- `app.runAiTurn` is set in initDuel. But startDuel could be called before initDuel? main calls initDuel before lobby use. Fine.
- toast.
- `app.deal=true; setTimeout(()=>app.deal=false,1000);`

`showTurnBanner(side)`: element span/b. Hide after 1150. Uses d.turnNo. Add class.
- If `side==='you'` class 'you', else 'opp'.
- text "YOUR TURN"/"OPPONENT TURN". span "TURN N".
- hidden attr false.
- Clear timer.
- Maybe sfx('select').

No need to await.

`renderDuel` after start then banner.

`zoneHTML` aria labels; `tabindex` on zones could add many tab stops; okay but maybe not. Use role button.

`zoneState` selected:
- For own field selection (not attackReady), selected if matching; for hand no.
- For emz own.

`targetable` only if attackReady and opponent entry.

`valid` only if canDropOn.

`renderDuel` after update, toggle opp LP targetable:
```js
const lp = $('oppLpBlock');
lp.classList.toggle('targetable', !!(app.sel?.type==='field'&&app.sel.attackReady&&d.ownMonsters('opp').length===0));
```

`renderNames` each time.

Now write duel-render.js.

